cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "vision-satellite-rendezvous: a closed-loop simulation framework for vision-based spacecraft rendezvous"
abstract: >-
  Closed-loop simulation framework for vision-based autonomous rendezvous with a
  tumbling, non-cooperative target. Couples Hill-Clohessy-Wiltshire relative
  dynamics, torque-free target attitude propagation, a monocular keypoint front
  end, RANSAC-EPnP pose estimation with manifold refinement, a multiplicative
  extended Kalman filter, and LQR and receding-horizon controllers.
